        differ, from each project's own docs, license and repository, checked on 27 October 2026 (HyperFrames
        0.8.209, Remotion 4.0.539). These projects move quickly; corrections are welcome as
        <a href={`${REPO}/issues`} rel="noopener">issues</a>.
      </p>
